{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015530/extras/52e0c4b15cc580e945581a5530873b71.avif?t=1758046398\" width=1232 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd84 <strong>My Voice Zoo</strong> is a unique idle zoo game brought to life with your own voice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record sounds through your microphone and turn them into the cries of animals,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >creating a truly one-of-a-kind zoo found nowhere else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time your recorded voice echoes as an animal\u2019s call, rewards pile up,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and as time passes, your zoo continues to grow on its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and enjoy a special zoo that can only be completed with your voice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Record Your Own Sounds</strong>: Roar like a lion, quack like a duck, baa like a sheep, or squawk like a penguin \u2014 every animal\u2019s voice can be yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Reward System</strong>: Adopt and place animals, then watch as they generate income automatically over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your Personal Zoo</strong>: Your recorded voices become the animals\u2019 calls, making your zoo unlike any other.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect &amp; Grow</strong>: Adopt adorable animals, give them names, complete your collection, and expand your zoo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Relaxing Experience</strong>: From moments of laughter to small surprises, enjoy a lighthearted way to relieve stress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f Only your voice can complete this extraordinary zoo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey now in <strong>My Voice Zoo</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb9 Music Credit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trailer Track : Baby Octopus Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BGM Track : BearMan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by : BGM President</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015530?t=1758046398","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015530/efa2e94af1d2e95199ae3da5217ea59e37f8230a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758046398","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015530/b382b12368b9ddc6f34a54ac152d8c1925208c1c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758046398","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015530/b382b12368b9ddc6f34a54ac152d8c1925208c1c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758046398","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015530/extras/52e0c4b15cc580e945581a5530873b71.avif?t=1758046398\" width=1232 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd84 <strong>My Voice Zoo</strong> is a unique idle zoo game brought to life with your own voice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record sounds through your microphone and turn them into the cries of animals,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >creating a truly one-of-a-kind zoo found nowhere else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time your recorded voice echoes as an animal\u2019s call, rewards pile up,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and as time passes, your zoo continues to grow on its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and enjoy a special zoo that can only be completed with your voice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Record Your Own Sounds</strong>: Roar like a lion, quack like a duck, baa like a sheep, or squawk like a penguin \u2014 every animal\u2019s voice can be yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Reward System</strong>: Adopt and place animals, then watch as they generate income automatically over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your Personal Zoo</strong>: Your recorded voices become the animals\u2019 calls, making your zoo unlike any other.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect &amp; Grow</strong>: Adopt adorable animals, give them names, complete your collection, and expand your zoo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Relaxing Experience</strong>: From moments of laughter to small surprises, enjoy a lighthearted way to relieve stress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f Only your voice can complete this extraordinary zoo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey now in <strong>My Voice Zoo</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb9 Music Credit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trailer Track : Baby Octopus Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BGM Track : BearMan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by : BGM President</p>","developers":["TRUSO"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://sh